msgstr "**The same input in every dataset.** Under `MultipleDatasetsSingleMeasurement` and `HierarchicalDatasetsAndRepeats` the fixture is called once per dataset with the same run seed; derive the input from `dataset_key.dataset_id`, otherwise every dataset is identical."

