#~ msgstr "`summarize`: count、extrema、mean、median、MAD、quartile、IQR、population standard deviation。"

#~ msgid "`paired_deltas` subtracts paired baseline values from candidate values."
#~ msgstr "`paired_deltas`: candidate から baseline を引いた paired delta。"

#~ msgid "`compare_paired` returns relative median delta, speedup, an interquartile interval, decision, and valid sample count."
#~ msgstr "`compare_paired`: relative median delta、speedup、quartile interval、decision、sample count。"

#~ msgid "`bootstrap_interval` returns a deterministic percentile interval for an explicit seed, resample count, confidence level, and interval mode."
#~ msgstr "`bootstrap_interval`: 明示的な seed、resample count、confidence level、interval mode から決定的な percentile bootstrap interval を返します。"

#~ msgid "`compare_paired_with_bootstrap` applies that interval to paired baseline/candidate measurements."
#~ msgstr "`compare_paired_with_bootstrap`: paired baseline/candidate measurement にその interval を適用します。"

#~ msgid "`filter_outliers` applies report-only, Tukey-fence, or MAD-trim policy."
#~ msgstr "`filter_outliers`: report-only、Tukey fence、MAD trim。"

